# Lets itsara (the gateway account) start ONLY the protected step-runner launcher as step-runner,
# without a password. The launcher accepts exactly one fixed-format request and execs
# /usr/bin/bwrap with a compiled-in argument vector (own user namespace, no further namespaces,
# one workspace bound from fd 1); see docs/step-runner-launcher.md. sudo-rs accepts only exact
# arguments or a trailing '*' in a command spec: the rule fixes the request version, the launcher
# validates everything else itself.
# Installed and removed only by /usr/local/libexec/step-runner-launch/install.
itsara ALL=(step-runner) NOPASSWD: /usr/local/libexec/step-runner-launch/launch v1 *
